{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26620154"}, "name":{"label":"jmfalcon00"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-22T08:07:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.98"}, "id":{"label":"14697595093"}, "title":{"label":"Ok game"}, "content":{"label":"The game is ok. The matching of equal level groups in match making is very bad. Very one sided match making. Super high level on one side and very low to mid level on the other side. Making the match very one sided. Game can be fun at times but very frustrating when other opponents fly their planes in ways it doesn’t in real life. But is a ok game.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
