{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1422072245"}, "name":{"label":"V4mpin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-16T09:35:00-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.98"}, "id":{"label":"14674102296"}, "title":{"label":"Why you should consider trying this game."}, "content":{"label":"I have played more thunder for about 5200 hours and this game has a better way of balancing when it comes to the grading system even though you may face radar missiles, which can be annoying. The game does still work the same by notching. The grading system is about the same to brawl stars but a little bit better. The game offers abilities like my favorite one being the J 35 SAAB Draken which you compare missiles with so that if you enemy doesn’t see, it’s an easy kill overall the game is fun and soon enough it will be released on PC for early access. I highly recommend recommended because it reminds me of when I played Ace Combat, the gameplay, kind of reflects that but with a little bit better overall gameplay.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
