{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id689943816"}, "name":{"label":"Undesirable savior"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-15T03:19:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.98"}, "id":{"label":"14668933542"}, "title":{"label":"It’s ok"}, "content":{"label":"Game where upgrading a specific plane too much, effectively makes it unplayable. Keep your planes at level 1-13 if you want to be able to compete. Game is no longer any fun once you upgrade the plane to the point of competing with bots  players who have shelled out serious cash. Keep your planes low level and the game is somewhat fair. It’s really unfortunate that the game isn’t capable of allowing for level reset. Kind of forces people to either hold back or upgrade planes to the point that they are unusable.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
