{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id661700847"}, "name":{"label":"PVT Parts612"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-05T02:39:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.97"}, "id":{"label":"14629969869"}, "title":{"label":"This game doesn’t want you to win"}, "content":{"label":"If you like your sanity, then I highly suggest you stay as far away from this game as possible. You unlock new jets with a currency called universal credits; you only get 10 universal credits every level and you need 100 to unlock a new jet. Every time you level up, you need more XP for the next level. I have unlocked about 1/4 of the jets in this game and I’m already at a point where I’d need to win at least 1000 matches just to unlock another jet, which is only made harder when the game goes out of its way to slow down your progress. I’ve seen level 30 players being matched against level 180 players, enemy bots playing at a level so advanced that skilled players will struggle to get a kill, let alone win, and friendly bots deliberately getting themselves killed just so you lose. But of course, you can always just buy 50 universal credits for $20", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
