{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1706873971"}, "name":{"label":"Ali91845"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-02T12:01:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.97"}, "id":{"label":"14619952733"}, "title":{"label":"PS"}, "content":{"label":"The game is absolutely amazing, it doesn’t make it too difficult to unlock craft, but it doesn’t make it easy either, the gameplay is smooth, the ONLY 2 issues I have is maybe a slight improvement on the graphics and more customization on private matches (Like a time or score limit) Also, and this is just a suggestion, but I’m sure a lot of people would love if the game was available and free for PlayStation and Xbox", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1257757023"}, "name":{"label":"Neatcash"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-01T15:11:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.97"}, "id":{"label":"14616554168"}, "title":{"label":"Great game but could add some finishing touches"}, "content":{"label":"These is really one of the only mobile games I grinded for more then a few weeks without deleting or getting bored, I’ve been playing since 2024-2025 so I can confidently say that it’s great especially for a mobile game. The graphics are really good, the models are really great, even little details like when a plane hits the ground and kicks up dust gives a nice feel. I feel like adding certain rwrs or sounds to certain planes would make it better, along with adding water physics, g-force (like the f20 ability), and a cockpit view. Other than that it’s pretty fun and definitely a game worth playing", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1461423243&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
